TI  - Deciphering the prognostic features of bladder cancer through gemcitabine resistance and immune-related gene analysis and identifying potential small molecular drug PIK-75.
AU  - Cai, Tingting
AU  - Feng, Tao
AU  - Li, Guangren
AU  - Wang, Jin
