TI  - Multi-omics identification of an immunogenic cell death-related signature for clear cell renal cell carcinoma in the context of 3P medicine and based on a 101-combination machine learning computational framework.
AU  - Liu, Jinsong
AU  - Shi, Yanjia
AU  - Zhang, Yuxin
