AB  - Testicular cancer is the most common cancer in men aged from 15 to 34 years. Lymphovascular invasion has prognostic significance in testicular germ cell tumours. We trained a deep learning classifier for automatic segmentation of areas suspicious for lymphovascular invasion in histological whole slide images of testicular germ cell tumours. Precision was 0.68 for areas appropriate to flag and 0.56 for definite lymphovascular invasion. An AI tool highlighting areas of possible lymphovascular invasion to pathologists is feasible in this proof-of-concept study.
