AB  - We investigated the performance of MRI-based Radiomics signatures for the preoperative prediction of testicular neoplasm histology: differentiating testicular germ cell tumors (TGCTs) and non-germ cell tumors, and seminomas from non-seminomatous tumors. Forty-two patients with pathology-proven testicular neoplasms and pre-treatment MRI were retrospectively enrolled. LASSO feature selection and linear/SVM classifiers gave overall accuracy of 89% for the TGCT-TNGCT endpoint and 86% for the seminoma endpoint. T2-weighted-based Radiomics is a promising tool in the diagnostic workup of testicular neoplasms.
