AB  - SELDI-TOF MS allows rapid protein profiling of complex biological mixtures. We analyzed testicular germ cell cancer serum samples to differentiate cancer from controls with a focus on beta-hCG-negative seminomas. An artificial intelligence learning algorithm correctly identified the pattern in 90.4% of patients; decision trees predicted seminomas with 91.5% sensitivity and 89.4% specificity. Validation may enable proteomic profiling as a valuable tool for aftercare.
